<http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ISTI-CNR LRMoo - An OWL DL implementation of the LRMoo (formerly FRBRoo)\nversion 0.7, created by Digital Humanities Group at AIMH Lab at Institute of Information Science and Technologies \"Alessandro Faedo\". It is based on the Draft Version v.0.7 of LRMoo (https://www.cidoc-crm.org/frbroo/sites/default/files/LRMoo_V0.7%28draft%202021-06-29%29.pdf). This implementation is currently under development by ISTI group. The ISTI-CNR LRMoo implementation is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License."@en .
