<http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R10_has_member> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/F1_Work> .
<http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R10_has_member> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property associates an instance of F1 Work with another instance of F1 Work that forms a part of it. This property is transitive. An instance of F1 Work may neither directly nor indirectly be a member of itself. Instances of F1 Work that are not members of one another may not share a common member."@en .
<http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R10_has_member> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R10 has member"@en .
