<http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R10i_is_member_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/F1_Work> .
<http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R10i_is_member_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/F1_Work> .
