<http://imagoarchive.it/ilrmoo/R2_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property associates an instance of F1 Work which modifies the content of another instance of F1 Work with the latter. This property is transitive. \n\nThe property R2.1 has type of this property allows for specifying the kind of derivation, such as adaptation, summarisation, etc."@en .
